SUMMARY:The Coffee Table Meetup ~ Ecusta Market & Café in Hendersonville 
 ☕️
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Famia suggested that our Senior Si
 ngles Fun Bunch have a weekly coffee meetup where folks can grab a cup of 
 coffee (or tea)\, enjoy easy conversation\, and make new connections. Soun
 ds great to me\, but due to my work schedule I will not be able to join yo
 u. Famia will be your host. Thank you\, Famia!! 💕**\n\n**The fairly new
  Ecusta Café & Market has a community-centered atmosphere so it’s the p
 erfect place for a coffee meetup!** **It’s** **also a market that sells 
 local meats\, produce & dairy among many other things.**\n\n**The café se
 rves craft coffee and tea\, and delicious pastries. They also serve breakf
 ast ~ check out the website below for the breakfast menu. There is indoor 
 and outside seating.**\n\n**WEBSITE/MENU:** **www.ecustamarketandcafe.com.
 **\n\n**PARKING:** **🅿️ Complimentary free parking for patrons and tr
 ail users.**\n\n**PETS: 🐶** **Well-behaved pets on leashes are allowed 
 in the outdoor seating area.**\n\n**Hope you will join Famia for coffee an
 d good conversation! ☕️**
