SUMMARY:Countryside BBQ 🍖- (Meetup after the highland cows farm tour)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Countryside BBQ is a down-home\, s
 eat-yourself BBQ restaurant. After being on the farm this would be a good 
 place to eat! It’s about 17 miles from the farm. A little far out\, but 
 if you’re hungry and like BBQ it will be worth it! 😋**\n**Of course\,
  all our members are invited! You don’t have to go on the farm tour firs
 t.**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE: countrysidebbq.net**\n\n**Hope you will join me he
 re after our farm tour!**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.c
 om**\n**(828) 699-8180 (Text or call)**
