SUMMARY:Let’s Go to the Zoo! The Greenville Zoo\, Greenville\, S.C. 🦁
 🦧🐘🦒🐊
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Let’s go to the zoo! And late Se
 ptember is a good month to do so for the weather isn’t so hot\, kids are
  back in school\, most tourists are gone\,etc. so it won’t be so crowded
  ~ hopefully!**\n\n**The Greenville Zoo is located on 14 acres. The total 
 walking distance is exactly one mile of a paved loop that gives you the op
 portunity to see every animal exhibit.**\n\n**There are plenty of mature t
 rees that provide shade and multiple benches to sit. And if you need a sna
 ck there is a concession stand. And\, of course\, restrooms.**\n\n**COST:*
 * **Adults ~ $15**\n**Seniors (65+) $12**\n**Tickets may be bought in adva
 nce online on their website. You may also just buy your ticket at the tick
 et booth when you arrive at the zoo.**\n\n**Website:** **www.greenvillezoo
 .com**\n\n**PARKING:** **Free parking**\n\n**EATING AFTER OUR ZOO TRIP:** 
 **For those who would like to we will be going to the Fork & Plough Restau
 rant to eat. It’s only 1.8 miles from the zoo. A 6-minute drive. Please 
 sign up on the separate Meetup event if you wish to go. I need a headcount
  for reservations. Thanks!**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS?**\n**Shae.kemerer@ao
 l.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (call or text)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31592957
